WEBVTT

00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:38.960
Last time on Dragon Ball Z, Goku and Gohan struggle to adapt their Super Saiyan strength to life at home.

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:42.970
Man, again? You've got to control it, like me. Watch this, see?

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:51.970
And when you're used to holding planet-conquering tyrants in your grip, passing the mashed potatoes can be one tricky job.

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:59.980
Cell's Deadly Tournament only days away, Goku was determined to enjoy the simplest...

