00:02:14.540 --> 00:02:20.100
If he stays there any longer, I'll knock that door down and calmly drag him out.

00:02:20.830 --> 00:02:22.250
Look, he's done.

00:02:23.570 --> 00:02:27.840
Well, it's about time.

00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:51.540
