00:17:46.630 --> 00:17:49.950
That way we'll have a new set of Dragon Balls, right?

00:17:51.330 --> 00:17:57.440
If we explain our situation, I'm sure they'd be happy to help.

00:17:58.700 --> 00:17:59.960
I would just love a...

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:01.700
new guardian to keep me company.

00:18:02.870 --> 00:18:05.470
But you don't have the time to be doing this.

00:18:06.100 --> 00:18:08.780
You don't even know what planet they're living on.

00:18:09.240 --> 00:18:11.040
It'd take years to find them.

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:12.700
I doubt that.

00:18:13.080 --> 00:18:15.500
