00:20:24.340 --> 00:20:24.880
They're not.

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:25.860
They're not.

00:20:26.330 --> 00:20:26.610
Mm-mm.

00:20:27.380 --> 00:20:27.860
Goku?

00:20:30.060 --> 00:20:33.340
Hey, nice to meet you. You make a good blonde.

00:20:33.840 --> 00:20:36.040
So, what brings you up here? Need some good jokes?

00:20:36.610 --> 00:20:39.490
No, no jokes. Not right now.

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:43.950
Don't you know about all the horrible things that are happening on Earth?

00:20:47.430 --> 00:20:51.090
Goku continues with his plan to bring Cell's victims back to life.

00:20:51.190 --> 00:20:55.000
But with the fateful World Martial Arts Tournament only days away,

00:20:55.320 --> 00:20:57.340
shouldn't he be thinking about his training?

